# Snippet - AI Based YouTube Video Summarizer

AI tool that converts long YouTube videos into 2-min highlights & summaries using NLP & Transformers.

## 🚀 Impact
- Reduces watch time by 80%
- Understand 1-hour video in 2 minutes

## 🛠 Tech Stack
Python, YouTube Transcript API, Transformers, NLP, Flask

## ✨ Features
- Auto transcript extraction from any YouTube video
- AI summary + key snippets extraction
- Flask web UI with save & search

## ▶️ How to Run
pip install -r requirements.txt
python app.py

